# Three players: Adeline's "for each opponent, create a 1/1 white Human creature token that's tapped and attacking that player"
# is one instruction, so the two Humans - one attacking Bot2, one attacking Bot3 - are created together in one event (CR 101.4),
# and Mister Fantastic, Reed Richards' "Whenever one or more tokens you control enter" triggers once for them, not once for
# each defender (CR 603.2c). Each Human is attacking its own opponent (CR 508.4).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Adeline, Resplendent Cathar
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mister Fantastic, Reed Richards
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Bot3 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Adeline, Resplendent Cathar.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot3.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mister Fantastic, Reed Richards.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot3.Pass
[T4 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Adeline, Resplendent Cathar > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot3.Pass
? Stack = Mister Fantastic, Reed Richards
? Stack.Count = 1

[Expect]
Combat.Attackers = Adeline, Resplendent Cathar > Bot2; Human Token > Bot2; Human Token > Bot3
